{"nodes": [{"type": "group", "id": "0fda7b9e973f4375", "x": -1660, "y": 8, "width": 1255, "height": 1237, "color": "#89dceb", "label": "Comment \u00e7a marche", "background": null, "backgroundStyle": null}, {"type": "group", "id": "aaa301b92c834dd5", "x": -615, "y": -2400, "width": 1230, "height": 1480, "color": "#cba6f7", "label": "Comp\u00e9tences chlorophylle", "background": null, "backgroundStyle": null}, {"type": "group", "id": "1f6533260d6f4e36", "x": 1398, "y": -722, "width": 930, "height": 1055, "color": "#cba6f7", "label": "\u00c9cologie v\u00e9g\u00e9tale", "background": null, "backgroundStyle": null}, {"type": "group", "id": "1bfaa3a2fc694b08", "x": -193, "y": 699, "width": 1080, "height": 1130, "color": "#cba6f7", "label": "Structure v\u00e9g\u00e9tale", "background": null, "backgroundStyle": null}, {"type": "group", "id": "a054740528d54407", "x": -2525, "y": -980, "width": 480, "height": 710, "color": "#cba6f7", "label": "R\u00e9flexion lumineuse", "background": null, "backgroundStyle": null}, {"type": "group", "id": "27e5fb80fd6d4e34", "x": 1660, "y": 1660, "width": 550, "height": 390, "color": "#f38ba8", "label": "\u00c0 ne pas confondre", "background": null, "backgroundStyle": null}, {"type": "group", "id": "699a078a49c74312", "x": -670, "y": 3210, "width": 1340, "height": 510, "color": "#f5c2e7", "label": "Sources", "background": null, "backgroundStyle": null}, {"type": "text", "id": "0d0c577b81ba49e1", "x": -1620, "y": 568, "width": 450, "height": 450, "color": "#a6e3a1", "text": "**Graphique**\n\n```tikz\n\n\\begin{tikzpicture}\n\\begin{axis}[\n    axis lines=middle,\n    grid=both,\n    domain=0:5,\n    samples=200,\n    xlabel={$x$},\n    ylabel={$f(x)$},\n    width=10cm,\n    height=8cm\n]\n\\addplot[blue, thick] {exp(-1*x^2)};\n\\end{axis}\n\\end{tikzpicture}\n\n```"}, {"type": "text", "id": "61e7c79057d745c3", "x": -1140, "y": 568, "width": 280, "height": 170, "color": null, "text": "### assimilats\n\nlumi\u00e8re, chlorophylle, H2O, CO2 \u2192 H+, e-, O2, assimilats (feuille)"}, {"type": "text", "id": "e837244ace0d4403", "x": -1140, "y": 88, "width": 280, "height": 170, "color": "#89dceb", "text": "### G3P\n\n\u00e9nergie emmagasin\u00e9e \u2192 G3P, ADP, Pi, NADP+"}, {"type": "text", "id": "b540a2c711bf4ac4", "x": -725, "y": 328, "width": 280, "height": 170, "color": "#89dceb", "text": "### ADP\n\n\u00e9nergie emmagasin\u00e9e \u2192 G3P, ADP, Pi, NADP+"}, {"type": "text", "id": "c27561316c2d4ce5", "x": -725, "y": 807, "width": 280, "height": 170, "color": "#89dceb", "text": "### NADP+\n\n\u00e9nergie emmagasin\u00e9e \u2192 G3P, ADP, Pi, NADP+"}, {"type": "text", "id": "48f0994db5e24c1c", "x": -1140, "y": 1060, "width": 280, "height": 145, "color": "#89dceb", "text": "### (CH2O)n\n\nCO2, AH2, photons \u2192 (CH2O)n, AO"}, {"type": "text", "id": "6d981ad8522d4e43", "x": -575, "y": -2000, "width": 400, "height": 220, "color": null, "text": "### Chlorophylle a\n\nLa chlorophylle a est la principale forme de chlorophylle pr\u00e9sente chez les organismes qui mettent en \u0153uvre la photosynth\u00e8se. On en trouve \u00e9galement en petite quantit\u00e9 chez les bact\u00e9ries vertes sulfureuses."}, {"type": "link", "id": "db56749999d44259", "x": -575, "y": -2320, "width": 400, "height": 300, "color": "#cba6f7", "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Why_are_plants_green.svg/500px-Why_are_plants_green.svg.png"}, {"type": "text", "id": "e9d9b32e040745f9", "x": -125, "y": -2000, "width": 400, "height": 270, "color": null, "text": "### Carot\u00e9no\u00efde\n\nLe terme de carot\u00e9no\u00efde regroupe les mol\u00e9cules des familles des carot\u00e8nes et des xanthophylles, aussi appel\u00e9s t\u00e9traterp\u00e8noides.\nLes carot\u00e9no\u00efdes sont des pigments plut\u00f4t orange et jaunes r\u00e9pandus chez de tr\u00e8s nombreux organismes vivants."}, {"type": "text", "id": "aa7f3c8c884d4a3f", "x": -425, "y": -1580, "width": 400, "height": 220, "color": "#cba6f7", "text": "#### Phyco\u00e9rythrine\n\nLa phyco\u00e9rythrine est une phycobiliprot\u00e9ine. C'est un pigment rouge que l'on trouve chez certaines cyanobact\u00e9ries, la plupart des algues rouges et certains cryptophytes."}, {"type": "text", "id": "2872b4f33d2b4898", "x": 175, "y": -1580, "width": 400, "height": 195, "color": "#cba6f7", "text": "#### Fucoxanthine\n\nLa fucoxanthine est un pigment xanthophylle de la famille des carot\u00e9no\u00efdes. Il donne leur couleur brune \u00e0 de nombreuses algues."}, {"type": "text", "id": "3bef993d45744b0d", "x": -575, "y": -1330, "width": 200, "height": 370, "color": null, "text": "#### Cas particuliers de photosynth\u00e8se\n\nCas particuliers de photosynth\u00e8se Plante au microscope \u00e9lectrique Animaux et photosynth\u00e8se La limace de mer , Elysia chlorotica , est le premier animal d\u00e9couvert capable d'utiliser la photosynth\u00e8se pour produire de l'\u00e9nergie."}, {"type": "text", "id": "02990c9421244e3b", "x": 1438, "y": -322, "width": 400, "height": 270, "color": null, "text": "### Biomasse (\u00e9cologie)\n\nEn \u00e9cologie, la biomasse est le terme qui d\u00e9signe la masse totale d'organismes vivants dans un biotope ou un lieu d\u00e9termin\u00e9 \u00e0 un moment donn\u00e9, qu'il s'agisse de plantes (phytomasse), d'animaux (zoomasse), de champignons ou de microbes (microbiomasse). L'humanit\u00e9 en tire notamment toute sa..."}, {"type": "link", "id": "863be883f68a440a", "x": 1438, "y": -642, "width": 400, "height": 300, "color": "#cba6f7", "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/BiomasseTotale.png/500px-BiomasseTotale.png"}, {"type": "text", "id": "57b4c06b9aa64acb", "x": 1888, "y": -322, "width": 400, "height": 270, "color": null, "text": "### Mati\u00e8re organique\n\nLa mati\u00e8re organique (parfois abr\u00e9g\u00e9e MO) est la mati\u00e8re fabriqu\u00e9e par les \u00eatres vivants (v\u00e9g\u00e9taux, animaux, champignons et autres d\u00e9composeurs dont micro-organismes).\nLa mati\u00e8re organique compose leurs tissus (tige, coquille, muscles, etc)."}, {"type": "text", "id": "30343e50708a461b", "x": 1888, "y": 98, "width": 400, "height": 195, "color": "#cba6f7", "text": "#### Biosynth\u00e8se\n\nBien qu'il y ait des diff\u00e9rences dans la biosynth\u00e8se r\u00e9alis\u00e9e par ces organismes, les m\u00e9canismes g\u00e9n\u00e9raux restent tout \u00e0 fait semblables d'une esp\u00e8ce \u00e0 l'autre."}, {"type": "text", "id": "910e1c25fdd34bc4", "x": 147, "y": 1099, "width": 400, "height": 270, "color": null, "text": "### Plante\n\nPerturbation du processus de photosynth\u00e8se Le processus de production d'oxyg\u00e8ne peut \u00eatre inhib\u00e9 par des causes externes, avec par exemple une pollution particulaire importante ( a\u00e9rosols ou d\u00e9p\u00f4ts secs ou humides) qui peut interf\u00e9rer avec les rayons solaires (les bloquer \u00e9ventuellement) ou nuire..."}, {"type": "link", "id": "15cc781a03d840dc", "x": 147, "y": 779, "width": 400, "height": 300, "color": "#cba6f7", "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/Pinus_silvestris_roots001xx.jpg/500px-Pinus_silvestris_roots001xx.jpg"}, {"type": "text", "id": "b9055e9b4c704f15", "x": -153, "y": 1519, "width": 400, "height": 270, "color": "#cba6f7", "text": "#### Feuille\n\nLa photosynth\u00e8se s'accomplit en deux phases : une phase claire (dite aussi \u00ab lumineuse \u00bb) durant laquelle la feuille capte la lumi\u00e8re, qui associ\u00e9e \u00e0 la chlorophylle r\u00e9alise la photolyse de l'eau, c\u2019est-\u00e0-dire la s\u00e9paration des atomes d\u2019 hydrog\u00e8ne et d' oxyg\u00e8ne , et une phase sombre (dite aussi \u00ab..."}, {"type": "text", "id": "e57a3c1aba5d4016", "x": 447, "y": 1519, "width": 400, "height": 270, "color": "#cba6f7", "text": "#### Racine (botanique)\n\nEn botanique, la racine est l'organe souterrain d'une plante servant \u00e0 la fixer au sol et \u00e0 y puiser l'eau et les \u00e9l\u00e9ments nutritifs n\u00e9cessaires \u00e0 son d\u00e9veloppement. Prolongement de la tige vers le bas (pas toujours, la racine peut \u00eatre issue de la radicule, organe embryonnaire, lorsque la tige..."}, {"type": "text", "id": "e18b162019e3451f", "x": -2485, "y": -580, "width": 400, "height": 270, "color": null, "text": "### Infrarouge\n\nLe rayonnement infrarouge (IR) est un rayonnement \u00e9lectromagn\u00e9tique de longueur d'onde sup\u00e9rieure \u00e0 celle du spectre visible mais plus courte que celle des micro-ondes ou du domaine t\u00e9rahertz.\nCette gamme de longueurs d'onde dans le vide de 700 nm \u00e0 0,1 ou 1 mm se divise en infrarouge proche, au..."}, {"type": "link", "id": "aad220d9ba004263", "x": -2485, "y": -900, "width": 400, "height": 300, "color": "#cba6f7", "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/Infrared_dog.jpg"}, {"type": "text", "id": "3d88359c2e334f55", "x": 1700, "y": 1740, "width": 220, "height": 270, "color": null, "text": "#### \u2260 respiration cellulaire\n\nLa photosynth\u00e8se produit O\u2082 et glucose \u00e0 partir de CO\u2082 et lumi\u00e8re. La respiration cellulaire fait l'inverse : consomme O\u2082 et glucose pour produire de l'\u00e9nergie."}, {"type": "text", "id": "a8c740e008dd43ab", "x": 1950, "y": 1740, "width": 220, "height": 220, "color": null, "text": "#### \u2260 chimiosynth\u00e8se\n\nLa chimiosynth\u00e8se utilise l'\u00e9nergie chimique au lieu de la lumi\u00e8re pour produire de la mati\u00e8re organique."}, {"type": "text", "id": "cd317838b8e349da", "x": -630, "y": 3290, "width": 400, "height": 180, "color": "#f5c2e7", "text": "PubMed Central"}, {"type": "text", "id": "0c0cba7714c14eef", "x": -200, "y": 3290, "width": 400, "height": 180, "color": "#f5c2e7", "text": "Nature (revue)"}, {"type": "text", "id": "509bed413e55488c", "x": 230, "y": 3290, "width": 400, "height": 180, "color": "#f5c2e7", "text": "Bibcode"}, {"type": "text", "id": "bfba15d365984aa8", "x": -630, "y": 3500, "width": 400, "height": 180, "color": "#f5c2e7", "text": "Association am\u00e9ricaine pour l'avancement des sciences"}], "edges": [{"id": "ce2c5200ab7d4589", "fromNode": "61e7c79057d745c3", "fromSide": "top", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "e837244ace0d4403", "toSide": "bottom", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "cycle d'assimilation du carbone"}, {"id": "5b9aa62183c245e4", "fromNode": "e837244ace0d4403", "fromSide": "right", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "b540a2c711bf4ac4", "toSide": "left", "toEnd": null, "color": "#89dceb", "label": "cycle d'assimilation du carbone"}, {"id": "b22a871e9c104482", "fromNode": "b540a2c711bf4ac4", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "c27561316c2d4ce5", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": "#89dceb", "label": "cycle d'assimilation du carbone"}, {"id": "88f7e8103b7f4144", "fromNode": "c27561316c2d4ce5", "fromSide": "left", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "48f0994db5e24c1c", "toSide": "right", "toEnd": null, "color": "#89dceb", "label": "produit"}, {"id": "3716e64dc37046fa", "fromNode": "e9d9b32e040745f9", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "aa7f3c8c884d4a3f", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "type de"}, {"id": "7204fba3a1074195", "fromNode": "e9d9b32e040745f9", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "2872b4f33d2b4898", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "type de"}, {"id": "23ecd476a93046b8", "fromNode": "57b4c06b9aa64acb", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "30343e50708a461b", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "produit par"}, {"id": "a867ad3a529b4dd9", "fromNode": "910e1c25fdd34bc4", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "b9055e9b4c704f15", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "composante de"}, {"id": "ff380e083b08491f", "fromNode": "910e1c25fdd34bc4", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "e57a3c1aba5d4016", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "composante de"}, {"id": "1fd791dc49374af1", "fromNode": "a054740528d54407", "fromSide": "right", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "aaa301b92c834dd5", "toSide": "left", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "contient"}, {"id": "6ac89e238a6743ab", "fromNode": "a054740528d54407", "fromSide": "right", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "1f6533260d6f4e36", "toSide": "left", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "R\u00e9flexion lumineuse \u2192 \u00c9cologie v\u00e9g\u00e9tale"}, {"id": "eea52c9757a14e64", "fromNode": "a054740528d54407", "fromSide": "right", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "1bfaa3a2fc694b08", "toSide": "left", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "R\u00e9flexion lumineuse \u2192 Structure v\u00e9g\u00e9tale"}, {"id": "6713f8d141ce4782", "fromNode": "aaa301b92c834dd5", "fromSide": "right", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "1f6533260d6f4e36", "toSide": "left", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "transforme en"}, {"id": "9cf2ca45a0924882", "fromNode": "aaa301b92c834dd5", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "1bfaa3a2fc694b08", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "contient"}, {"id": "bdd28c027b9e454a", "fromNode": "1f6533260d6f4e36", "fromSide": "left", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "1bfaa3a2fc694b08", "toSide": "right", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "\u00c9cologie v\u00e9g\u00e9tale \u2192 Structure v\u00e9g\u00e9tale"}]}